          "text": "Exact cached patched archive and class hashes independently confirm the login ordering. Final offline regression and build results are retained separately from live acceptance; post-fix staff behavior remains NOT_RUN.",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "patched-bytecode-identity",
            "offline-verification-summary"
          ]
        }
